{"unit_id":"zhifeiNi__dsh-usage-orb#card-zh","repo":"zhifeiNi/dsh-usage-orb","commit":"fa859023b4cd72a71e8482fe2902539073bfb224","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 用量光球是面向 Web 客户端的用量统计浮动面板。它由宿主插件注册用量与会话明细路由，并在页面挂载可拖动的圆环入口和面板。主要功能包括跨会话 token 与成本汇总、模型和工具统计、余额历史、逐轮下钻及用量分享卡片。适合希望查看 DSH 多会话用量的人；余额显示依赖宿主账户服务，统计数据来自本机 DSH 会话记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-349","lib/client.js:3394-3401"]}
{"unit_id":"zhifeiNi__dsh-usage-orb#card-en","repo":"zhifeiNi/dsh-usage-orb","commit":"fa859023b4cd72a71e8482fe2902539073bfb224","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Usage Orb adds a floating dashboard to DSH web. Its host registers usage and session routes; the page mounts a draggable ring and panel. It summarizes cross-session tokens and costs, model and tool usage, balance history, and per-turn details, and exports share cards.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-349","lib/client.js:3394-3401"]}
